cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "RIS Deployment Planning Tool"
abstract: >-
  A single-file MATLAB GUI application that computes site-specific link
  budgets for RIS-assisted hybrid RF/FSO relay deployments in rural
  Zimbabwe, implementing closed-form expressions for end-to-end outage
  probability, ergodic capacity, and average bit error rate with
  terrain-calibrated Nakagami-m and season-calibrated Gamma-Gamma
  channel parameters.
